---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../site.json';
import ads from '../config/monetization.json';
const live=site.launchReady&&ads.coupang.enabled&&Object.values(ads.coupang.dynamicBanners).some(b=>b.enabled);
---
<Layout title={'Privacy | '+site.title} description={'Privacy information for '+site.title}>
<div class="wrap content"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy notice</h1>
<p>Reviewed: 30 October 2026. This static information website has no user accounts or comment form.</p>
<h2>Hosting and external links</h2><p>The host may process technical request data such as IP addresses, timestamps and request headers. External documentation websites have their own privacy notices.</p>
<h2>Affiliate advertising</h2>
{live?<p>Coupang Partners dynamic ads are configured. Third-party code may load recommended products and process information under Coupang's policies. Relevant cookie and consent requirements must be assessed for visitors before activation.</p>:<p>Coupang Partners dynamic banners and Google AdSense scripts are disabled until configured and the relevant privacy and consent requirements are completed.</p>}
<p>Read our <a href="/disclosure/">advertising disclosure</a>.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2><p>This policy must be revised if analytics, advertising, cookies, embeds or forms are introduced or changed.</p></div>
</Layout>